# shell/mesh-repos.list — paths whose `claude` invocations get redirected
# to $MESH_IDENTITY_DIR by mesh-guard.zsh.
#
# One path per line. When cwd matches any prefix below, mesh-guard offers
# to `cd` into the identity repo before running claude.
#
# Example:
# /home/you/mesh-workstation
# /home/you/some-other-project
